{"seq":1,"slug":"funnel-metrics","title":"CTR、加购、转化与 GMV 的性能敏感点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/core-metrics-map/business-metrics/funnel-metrics","wordCount":2863,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"ctr-加购-转化与-gmv-的性能敏感点\">CTR、加购、转化与 GMV 的性能敏感点</h1><p>「性能提升能带来多少收益」这个问题如果不能回答，性能投入就永远排在需求列表末尾。回答它的路径是把技术指标挂到漏斗上：一次搜索变慢，影响的不是「转化率」这一个抽象数字，而是曝光量、点击率、加购率、下单率、支付成功率这五个环节各自的一个具体幅度。而且这五个环节对延迟的敏感度差异巨大——加购环节对延迟极其敏感（用户正在比较，时间长了就关掉），支付环节反而相对不敏感（用户已经决定买了）。把这种差异量化，才能把有限的优化资源投到真正影响收入的环节上。本篇建立漏斗各环节的敏感度模型，给出分群归因的方法，并明确哪些数字可以跨业务借用、哪些绝对不能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>电商搜索的转化漏斗是一条有损链路，每一级都有流失，而延迟对每一级的放大系数不同。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>U</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">GMV = UV \\times R_{search} \\times R_{click} \\times R_{cart} \\times R_{order} \\times AOV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GM</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">UV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是访问用户数，各级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是条件转化率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AOV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是客单价。性能影响的是各级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，而各级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 对延迟的弹性不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>漏斗环节</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>对延迟的敏感度</th>\n<th>主要流失原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>曝光</td>\n<td>曝光量、有结果率</td>\n<td>出现结果卡片的会话占比</td>\n<td>高（超时即无曝光）</td>\n<td>首屏超时、零结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点击</td>\n<td>CTR</td>\n<td>点击 / 曝光</td>\n<td><strong>最高</strong></td>\n<td>结果出现慢导致直接离开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加购</td>\n<td>加购率</td>\n<td>加购 / 点击</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>详情页与搜索页往返慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下单</td>\n<td>下单率</td>\n<td>下单 / 加购</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>结算流程延迟、库存校验慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付</td>\n<td>支付成功率</td>\n<td>支付成功 / 下单</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>超时重试、第三方通道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>敏感度差异的机理解释很重要，因为它决定了优化优先级是否可迁移。<strong>点击环节敏感度最高</strong>的原因是用户在搜索结果页处于「比较模式」——他在同时评估多个选项，延迟会让比较过程被打断，而打断的代价是直接离开（因为还有别的应用可比）。<strong>支付环节敏感度最低</strong>的原因是用户已经完成了心理决策，此时等待被理解为「系统在处理」，容忍度显著更高。<strong>加购与下单处于中间</strong>，且加购比下单更敏感，因为加购是一个探索性动作（用户还在选），下单是承诺性动作。</p>\n<p>一个必须记住的结论：<strong>「延迟降低 X% 带来转化提升 Y%」这类数字不能跨业务照搬。</strong> 原因有三：转化率基线不同（基线越低，同样绝对提升对应越高的相对提升）、流量构成不同（高意向流量占比高的站点对延迟更不敏感）、竞品可替代性不同（用户有更好替代品时延迟的代价更大）。可迁移的是<strong>方法与量级</strong>，不是具体系数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[搜索请求] --&gt; B{延迟分布}&#10;    B --&gt;|P50 快| C[结果快速呈现]&#10;    B --&gt;|P99 慢| D[用户等待/放弃]&#10;    C --&gt; E[曝光]&#10;    D --&gt; F[曝光损失&lt;br/&gt;高延迟会话曝光率下降]&#10;    E --&gt; G{CTR 判定}&#10;    G --&gt;|结果相关且快| H[点击]&#10;    G --&gt;|慢或自认不相关| I[离开, 无点击]&#10;    H --&gt; J[详情页]&#10;    J --&gt; K{加购判定}&#10;    K --&gt;|往返快| L[加购]&#10;    K --&gt;|往返慢, 放弃比价| M[流失]&#10;    L --&gt; N[下单]&#10;    N --&gt; O[支付]&#10;    O --&gt; P[GMV]&#10;    F --&gt; Q[统一计入漏斗损失]&#10;    I --&gt; Q&#10;    M --&gt; Q\">flowchart TD\n    A[搜索请求] --&gt; B{延迟分布}\n    B --&gt;|P50 快| C[结果快速呈现]\n    B --&gt;|P99 慢| D[用户等待/放弃]\n    C --&gt; E[曝光]\n    D --&gt; F[曝光损失&lt;br/&gt;高延迟会话曝光率下降]\n    E --&gt; G{CTR 判定}\n    G --&gt;|结果相关且快| H[点击]\n    G --&gt;|慢或自认不相关| I[离开, 无点击]\n    H --&gt; J[详情页]\n    J --&gt; K{加购判定}\n    K --&gt;|往返快| L[加购]\n    K --&gt;|往返慢, 放弃比价| M[流失]\n    L --&gt; N[下单]\n    N --&gt; O[支付]\n    O --&gt; P[GMV]\n    F --&gt; Q[统一计入漏斗损失]\n    I --&gt; Q\n    M --&gt; Q</pre><h2 id=\"分群-同一段延迟对不同用户不是同一件事\">分群：同一段延迟对不同用户不是同一件事</h2><p>把「延迟降低 200ms」当作对所有人等同的干预，是漏斗分析最常见的错误。实际上延迟的影响高度分群，至少四个维度必须拆开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分群维度</th>\n<th>分组</th>\n<th>敏感度差异</th>\n<th>归因方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户意向</td>\n<td>高意向（有明确购买目标）vs 闲逛</td>\n<td>高意向更敏感</td>\n<td>按会话内搜索次数、是否有加购历史分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备/网络</td>\n<td>移动弱网 vs 桌面宽带</td>\n<td>弱网用户对固定延迟更敏感</td>\n<td>按设备类型、网络类型（可由 RUM 获取）分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新老用户</td>\n<td>新用户 vs 老用户</td>\n<td>新用户对慢更不容忍（无品牌耐心）</td>\n<td>按登录状态、注册时长分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流量来源</td>\n<td>自然搜索 vs 广告投放</td>\n<td>广告流量敏感度更高（有成本）</td>\n<td>按 referrer、渠道参数分组</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分群的价值在于<strong>定位</strong>：如果延迟改善只惠及人群 A 而人群 B 无变化，说明瓶颈在 A 特有的链路上（比如 A 走的是未优化的移动端接口）。如果改善惠及所有人但业务指标不动，说明瓶颈不在延迟上，而在别的环节。</p>\n<p>一个具体的统计陷阱：<strong>延迟与转化率的关系在整体数据上常呈现弱相关甚至反向</strong>。原因是存在混杂因素——缓存命中的请求既快又往往对应热门商品（本来转化率就高）；而搜索冷门词的请求既慢又难转化。整体看「慢的请求转化率低」，但这个低转化是「冷门查询」这个共同原因造成的，不是延迟造成的。消除混杂的方法是<strong>条件化</strong>：在同一查询热度分桶内看延迟与转化的关系，或者用受控实验（随机对部分用户施加延迟）——这是区分相关与因果的必要手段，其细节在 <a href=\"impact-map\">指标影响地图：技术指标动了影响哪个业务指标</a> 中有方法论展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"敏感度的量化与弹性系数\">敏感度的量化与弹性系数</h2><p>要把「延迟降低 200ms 影响多少 GMV」算出来，需要一个可用的量化框架。推荐用弹性系数而非绝对数字：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{i} = \\frac{\\Delta R_i / R_i}{\\Delta L / L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 级转化率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是延迟。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的含义是「延迟相对变化 1%，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 级转化率相对变化多少」。用相对量而非绝对量的好处是可以跨流量规模比较，且系数比绝对数字更稳定。</p>\n<p>实证参考的量级（这些数字来自公开的行业实验，用作量级参照而非可直接照搬的承诺）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>观测</th>\n<th>量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Amazon 的经典实验</td>\n<td>页面加载每增 100ms</td>\n<td>销售额下降约 1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Walmart 的实验报道</td>\n<td>每改善 1 秒加载</td>\n<td>转化率提升约 2%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google 的移动端分析</td>\n<td>加载从 1s 增到 3s</td>\n<td>移动端跳出率显著上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bing 的实验</td>\n<td>延迟增加 100–400ms</td>\n<td>收入出现可测量的下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deloitte 的移动端报告</td>\n<td>每 0.1s 改善</td>\n<td>零售转化率提升约 1 个百分点量级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>上表的数字彼此不能直接换算（口径不同、站点不同、时段不同），但它们共同给出一个可用的量级感：<strong>对电商搜索这类场景，百毫秒级的延迟变化对应百分之零点几到百分之几的转化变化</strong>。这意味着两件事：一是性能优化确实有可观收益；二是<strong>只有能分辨 1% 级别差异的实验设计才能验证它</strong>，否则会被噪声淹没，得出「性能优化无效果」的错误结论。样本量估算与显著性判定属于实验方法论的范畴，本篇只强调：<strong>性能收益的量级决定了验证它的实验必须足够大</strong>。</p>\n<p>加入成本侧后得到完整的收益公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>⋅</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta Profit = GMV \\cdot \\sum_i \\left( \\prod_{j&lt;i} R_j \\right) \\cdot E_i \\cdot \\frac{\\Delta L}{L} - C_{opt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GM</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{opt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是优化投入（人力 + 可能增加的机器成本）。当优化通过增加机器换延迟时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{opt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 包含增量成本，两者必须一起比较——这是 <a href=\"../cost-freshness-metrics/efficiency-metrics\">单位成本吞吐与资源利用率</a> 讨论的成本侧对应项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从漏斗反推优化优先级\">从漏斗反推优化优先级</h2><p>有了敏感度模型，优先级排序可以摆脱「哪里最慢先改哪里」的直觉（这个直觉经常错，因为最慢的环节可能是不敏感的那一环）。</p>\n<p>排序算法：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>测出每一级的当前延迟贡献。</strong> 用分布式追踪把单个会话的总耗时分解到各环节（搜索请求、结果渲染、详情页加载、结算校验）。</li>\n<li><strong>为每一级乘上敏感度系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与流经比例。</strong> 流经比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod_{j&lt;i} R_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 意味着一级越靠后，即使敏感度高，受影响的用户也越少。</li>\n<li><strong>计算每个候选优化项的「收益 / 成本」比并排序。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>优先选择能同时改善多级的优化项。</strong> 例如把首屏 HTML 从 200KB 降到 60KB，同时改善曝光与点击两级；把接口 p99 从 2s 降到 500ms 也同时改善多级。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一个被低估的优化项是<strong>尾部而非中位数</strong>。因为漏斗的一级决定下一级的分母，尾部的损失是乘性的：一个会话在搜索页遇到 3 秒延迟而离开，它后续的加购、下单、支付全部归零。因此改善 p99 对 GMV 的边际贡献往往大于改善 p50——这与 <a href=\"../request-metrics/latency-percentiles\">延迟：平均值为什么骗人，p50/p95/p99 的业务含义</a> 中「分位数选择对应用户分层」的结论一致，只是这里的分层依据是漏斗位置而非用户价值。</p>\n<p>同样的逻辑解释了为什么<strong>零结果率是漏斗最大的单点损失</strong>：零结果的会话在曝光到点击这一级直接归零，后续所有环节的损失都是 100%，且不可挽回（不像慢只是降低了概率）。这一点使零结果率成为比延迟更值得优先处理的指标——它的具体口径见 <a href=\"../client-experience-metrics/correctness-metrics\">成功率、零结果率与功能正确性指标</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>候选优化项</th>\n<th>影响环节</th>\n<th>用户占比</th>\n<th>敏感度</th>\n<th>综合优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消除零结果</td>\n<td>曝光→点击</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>极高（归零）</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首屏主图压缩</td>\n<td>曝光、点击</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接口 p99 从 2s 降到 600ms</td>\n<td>曝光、点击、加购</td>\n<td>尾部 5–10%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算库存校验并行化</td>\n<td>下单、支付</td>\n<td>已点击用户</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付通道重试优化</td>\n<td>支付</td>\n<td>下单用户</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>详情页图片懒加载策略调整</td>\n<td>加购</td>\n<td>点击用户</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的排序结果经常与「哪个环节最慢」的排序不同——这正是敏感度模型的价值：<strong>它把「慢」转换成「损失了多少可挽回的用户」</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>转化漏斗是有损链路，延迟对各级转化率的弹性不同：点击环节最敏感（比较模式被打断），支付环节最不敏感（决策已完成）。</li>\n<li>「延迟降低 X% 带来转化提升 Y%」的系数不可跨业务照搬；可迁移的是方法与量级，不是具体数字。</li>\n<li>分群四维度：用户意向、设备网络、新老用户、流量来源；不拆分的平均效应会掩盖真实瓶颈位置。</li>\n<li>整体数据上延迟与转化常呈弱相关甚至反向，因为冷门查询同时导致「慢」和「低转化」；必须条件化或做受控实验。</li>\n<li>量化用弹性系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而非绝对数字；公开实证给出的量级是「百毫秒对应百分之零点几到百分之几的转化变化」。</li>\n<li>优先级排序要乘上流经比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod_{j&lt;i} R_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：越靠后的环节即使敏感度高，受影响用户也越少。</li>\n<li>尾部延迟的损失是乘性的（会话中途离开导致后续环节全部归零），因此改善 p99 对 GMV 的边际贡献常大于改善 p50。</li>\n<li>零结果率是漏斗的单点最大损失（该会话后续环节全部归零），优先级应高于延迟优化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CTR、加购、转化与 GMV 的性能敏感点","id":"ctr-加购-转化与-gmv-的性能敏感点"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分群：同一段延迟对不同用户不是同一件事","id":"分群-同一段延迟对不同用户不是同一件事"},{"level":2,"text":"敏感度的量化与弹性系数","id":"敏感度的量化与弹性系数"},{"level":2,"text":"从漏斗反推优化优先级","id":"从漏斗反推优化优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"成功率、零结果率与功能正确性指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/core-metrics-map/client-experience-metrics/correctness-metrics"},"next":{"title":"SEO 排名、获客成本与留存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/core-metrics-map/business-metrics/seo-retention"}}